  "name": "Rush, Swift Leap & Satyr's Landing",
  "description": "\u00a7e\u00a7lRush:\u00a7r\nPress your Primary Ability key to dash in the direction you are looking.\n \n\u00a7e\u00a7lSwift Leap:\u00a7r\nAt maximum Momentum, press Jump while airborne to launch yourself upward once. Swift Leap resets when you touch the ground.\n \n\u00a7e\u00a7lSatyr's Landing:\u00a7r\nPress Sneak while airborne to dive toward the ground. Landing deals 7 cramming damage in a 3-block radius. Hitting a creature instead resets Swift Leap and bounces you upward, up to 2 times.\n \nYou deal 50% less projectile damage for 3 seconds after Rush. \u00a7e\u00a7lMovement Ability\u00a7r."
